    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just about needing a rest though. like, even when i'm alone, i'm still exhausted. i feel like i'm just existing in a way that doesn't even make sense anymore. it feels like there's no real version of me that gets to actually live, you know? it just feels like a losing battle that never ends.",
